00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:31.950
That is how the nervous system
converts physical stimuli

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:34.290
in the world into events within

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:35.760
the nervous system that we come

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:38.400
