00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:44.040
Dr. Zuker's lab

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.810
is responsible for a tremendous amount

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:48.000
of pioneering and groundbreaking work

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.100
in the area of perception,

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.170
for a long time his
laboratory worked on vision,

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:55.320
defining the very receptors
that allow for the conversion

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:57.220
