00:01:16.710 --> 00:01:18.690
Dr. Zuker's laboratory is also responsible

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:21.660
for doing groundbreaking
work on the sense of thirst.

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:24.150
That is how the nervous
system determines whether

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:26.160
or not we should ingest more fluid

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:28.950
or reject fluids that are offered to us.

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:31.650
A key feature of the work
from Dr. Zuker's laboratory

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:34.170
