00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:40.140
His laboratory has discovered
a unique set of sugar sensing

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:42.690
neurons that exist not
just within the brain,

00:01:42.690 --> 00:01:43.890
but a separate set of neurons.

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:46.920
That sense sweetness and
sugar within the body.

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:49.170
And that much of the
communication between the brain

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:51.840
and body leading to our seeking of sugar

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:53.880
is below our conscious detection.

