that kind of a podcast.

01:09:45.030 --> 01:09:47.310
- No, well, the reason I,

01:09:47.310 --> 01:09:49.920
but this has to do with taste
because she said something,

01:09:49.920 --> 01:09:54.180
I think in part to
maybe irritate me a bit,

01:09:54.180 --> 01:09:56.520
but we were commenting not

