01:29:00.840 --> 01:29:03.700
of the body telling your brain

01:29:05.760 --> 01:29:10.760
what you need in important
things like sugar and fat,

01:29:11.310 --> 01:29:14.618
but anyways, go ahead, you
were going to ask something.

01:29:14.618 --> 01:29:16.806
- Well, no, I would like to discuss

01:29:16.806 --> 01:29:20.640
the most basic elements of
internal state in particular,

01:29:20.640 --> 01:29:23.190
the ones that are below
